## Implementation complete

All 15 plan slices from `.sandcastle/plans/364.md` have been implemented on branch `sandcastle/issue-364-luau-execution-list-logs`.

### What was done

A new `listLogs` method was added to the `@bedrock-rbx/ocale` Luau Execution surface, shipping under the existing `@bedrock-rbx/ocale/luau-execution` subpath with no new package subpath.

**New sub-tree: `src/domains/cloud-v2/luau-execution-task-logs/`**

- `types.ts` — `ListLogsParameters`, `LogMessage`, `LogPage` (with `createTime` kept as `string`, not `Date`)
- `wire.ts` — `LogMessageWire`, `LogChunkWire`, `ListLogsResponseWire` (internal, not re-exported)
- `builders.ts` — `buildListLogsRequest`: validates `versionId`/`sessionId` completeness, hard-codes `view=STRUCTURED`, serializes `pageSize → maxPageSize` and `pageToken` as query params
- `parsers.ts` — `parseListLogsResponse`: flattens chunks into a single `messages` array, rejects `MESSAGE_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED`, propagates status code on `ApiError`
- `operations.ts` — `LIST_LOGS_OPERATION_LIMIT` (45 req/min) and `LIST_LOGS_REQUIRED_SCOPES` (`:read`)
- `specs.ts` — frozen `LIST_LOGS_SPEC` with `methodKind: "idempotent"`

**Resource bindings**

- `TasksHandle.listLogs` on `LuauExecutionClient` (dispatch via `LIST_LOGS_SPEC`)
- `LuauExecutionHandle.listLogs` on `PlacesClient` (same spec, same types)
- Both surfaces share the same frozen singleton instance, confirmed by the shared-specs conformance pin

**Test coverage**

- 7 builder tests (URL shape, incomplete-ref validation, query param serialization)
- 16 parser tests (empty page, single/multiple message mapping, `MESSAGE_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED` rejection, `nextPageToken` surfacing, 7 malformed-body cases, status code propagation)
- 2 operation tests (rate limit, scope)
- 1 spec test (frozen, idempotent kind, wired to correct limit/scope/parser)
- 2 integration tests (one per surface, asserting GET URL and `LogPage` parse)
- Conformance pin extended to include `LIST_LOGS_SPEC`

